  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Dogwash Perle and Co, in Mouans-Sartoux, in the Grasse-Cannes area, is a dog washing space created by Baptiste, a qualified dog breeder, and officially opened on 29 March (2026). The space is fenced, camera-monitored and fitted with professional equipment, with hypoallergenic shampoos suited to all types of dogs. Next door, a secure 105 sqm dog park with an airlock lets your dog burn off energy.</p>
      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>It is open 7 days a week, 9am to 7pm. Three options: self-service wash at €14, no appointment; wash by appointment at €30, where you drop off your dog and the team does the washing and drying; and the dog taxi, by reservation and on quote, which picks your dog up at home and brings it back clean. The dog park is free while using the machine, and €2 otherwise. Booking is done online on the website or on 07 65 88 54 44.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: make the most of the dog park while you wait, it's included in the price of the wash.</div>
      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Mouans-Sartoux, between Grasse and Cannes, gives quick access both to the perfumeries of Grasse and to the Cannes coastline.</p>
